:name: STM32H7_CORE VELXIO interactive REPL
:description: Interactive boot. USART1 exposed on TCP port 3456 (telnet-style).
:description: Run Renode from the root of the repo: the paths are relative to it.

$bin?=@prebuilt/stm32h7/firmware.elf
# Renode runs from its own directory: logs go to an absolute path.
$renodelog?="/tmp/renode_velxio_repl.log"

using sysbus
mach create "h743_velxio"
include @renode/extensions/Winbond_W25Q.cs
machine LoadPlatformDescription @renode/platforms/stm32h7_core_v13.repl

logLevel 3
logFile $renodelog true
logLevel -1 sysbus.usart1

# Expose USART1 on TCP port 3456 (no telnet protocol, raw)
emulation CreateServerSocketTerminal 3456 "uart1term" false
connector Connect sysbus.usart1 uart1term

macro reset
"""
    cpu VectorTableOffset 0x08000000
    sysbus LoadELF $bin
"""
runMacro $reset

start
